


   =====( ViewPacket V1.00 )=========================================


        Trion 'ViewPacket' Utility.

        (c) Copyright Paul Spijkerman, '96-'97. All rights reserved.

        Written for use with the Trion BBS package.


   ===================================================================


   ViewPacket is a small programm wich will show the contents of
   a fidonet compatible mail packet.
   This can be usefull when there is some problem.

   It will show all fields separetly with all fields in raw form,
   just the numbers .. and the password in ASCII characters and
   decimal numbers.
   Then it will give a summary of what the important complete fields 
   are like nodenumbers, mail processor, password and packet time.
   And finaly it will give a list with a little information on all
   messages, like Message time, Message flags, To, From and subject
   string, the area name if it was echomail and the nodenumber
   the message originated from.
   And at the bottom the programm will show the number of messages
   in the packet.

